WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.027
Wait — why does our app look exactly like the team next door's?

00:00:04.027 --> 00:00:07.935
I deployed a hundred agents and shipped a hundred apps! Impressive, right?

00:00:07.935 --> 00:00:11.488
Just make them reason differently. Huh? Mine looks identical too?

00:00:11.488 --> 00:00:15.514
A hundred apps all the same purple aren't a hundred — they're one.

00:00:15.514 --> 00:00:17.646
Aaah! A bird just ripped the template away!

00:00:17.646 --> 00:00:20.725
But the app still works? Guess only the borrowed face flew off.

00:00:20.725 --> 00:00:24.041
Hereby declared: a face isn't borrowed — it's grown!

